<title>USA: Litchfield CS, Mich., won by Dean Witter.</title>
<headline>Litchfield CS, Mich., won by Dean Witter.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dean Witter Reynolds Inc. said it won $3.715 million of Litchfield CS, Mich., general obligation 1997 school building and site bonds, with a net interest cost of 5.20 percent.</p>
</text>
